{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-07", "pageid": 110911, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-06\" title=\"三重赋格-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-08\" title=\"三重赋格-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.87.83.E7.83.A7.E7.9A.84.E7.A9.BA.E7.99.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"燃烧的空白\">燃烧的空白</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 燃烧的空白</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Burned to Ashes</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你跟弗兰兹吵架了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他受了伤，我送他回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他答非所问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔张嘴想说些什么，但她脸上的阴翳突然变得浓重，卡戎微微侧目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>这几天过得怎么样？明天野战医院撤离的时候，你可得忙上一阵子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>下午好，中校，希望一切顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便是常被人诟病迟缓的卡戎，也注意到了中校的不同寻常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>您怎么没有佩枪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>战壕里，一个没有配枪的军官确实不常见，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中校笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>战争很快就会结束，我已经在等待退役了……我的孙女快要出生了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>我不想再佩枪，或许我也不需要再佩枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我记得上次您妻子来信，说家里准备开一间酒馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>是的，她知道的，如果我不再是军人，最想做的就是开酒馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>每天接待客人，凑在一起开开玩笑，再来两局斯卡特牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>偶尔给他们免个单，好叫他们把家人朋友都带来聚聚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>弗兰兹一定想去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>那就叫他来，我给他佐一份免费的香肠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>在战场里太久，我们都需要试着回忆正常人是怎么样生活的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎看向站在一边沉默不语的帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔知道他想对自己说什么，但她的心没法这样轻易地平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>沃尔克中校，你在情报可能有误的情况下，下令炮击，误伤了友方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我的未婚夫瓦尔特死于那次来自友方的炮击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沃尔克中校侧身，看向女性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>一个和我女儿差不多大的姑娘，看向我的眼神却像是看着敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>我很少遇到这样的情况，但我清楚我恐怕罪有应得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>或许还有千千万万个这样的姑娘，只是你看不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>的确，我有这样的心理准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你最好真的有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中校的目光扫过帕蒂塔的每一寸冷漠和仇恨，他无奈地笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>瓦尔特很年轻，但他是个健谈、敏锐且有思考的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>他刚来前线时甚至不愿意开枪，但这不是因为他懦弱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你没必要跟我打这种感情牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>帕蒂塔，我们所有人都是坦克的履带板，收到推进的命令就只能碾过一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>在前线，除了赢，只有死。而这种死，不仅仅是我——一个匹夫的死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>我非常后悔和惋惜瓦尔特的牺牲——至少比起真正命令我们推进的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你想要推卸责任？告诉我该死的另有其人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>当然不，战争是仇恨和死亡的长河，我走了进来，我的生命当然也能被它收割。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>如果你想要杀死我，这无妨，只是你也必须走进这条河里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>帕蒂塔，尽管杀死我，我不会有任何怨言，只要你真的做好了准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔的唇齿微微颤动，她几次尝试，却还是什么也没说出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中校回身呼喝了一名中士的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>你申领的枪到了，帕蒂塔，我把它交给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她接过了这把小巧的袖珍手枪，轻轻掂量它的重量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎目送中校离去，随后看向帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他是一位等待退役的老人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>现在你要对我说教了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>夺走生命只能让痛苦变本加厉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>很好，保罗，快把你的漂亮话一口气说干净，这种耍帅的机会对你来说不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我们还有一个约定，医院撤离，你轮换回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩始终垂着头盯着那把枪，她似乎在打量手枪的构件，又似乎只是在走神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>带着这些记忆，我能回到哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我想寻找瓦尔特的死因，也只是需要一个活下去的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>即便那个理由荒谬可笑，又或者那个理由是仇恨本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>但沃尔克中校竟然是有家可回的那个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>帕蒂塔，除了战场，你可以去任何你想去的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我没有想去的地方，也找不到其他生存的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>可能我不太明白人们的生存理由，但我身边的士兵们明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他们有的在等待回家拥抱亲人，有的在等待战后把院子打理成花园。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>即使是在酒馆从白天喝到晚上，对他们来说也是一种活下去的信念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……或是一种遥不可及的奢望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>人们总能找到形形色色的意义来生存下去，你也一样可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>不是每个人都可以忍受剖心的痛苦，还有不断寻找却根本没有答案的煎熬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>保罗，你比我更清楚，这一切根本没有意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>你已经承认一切都没有意义，你对我的劝告只是出于人道关怀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我的生存理由或许荒谬，但忍受毫无必要的痛苦生活，难道就有意义了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩挥动手掌，弹匣脱离，她一粒粒地取出子弹，只余留一粒装回枪中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将取出的子弹塞进卡戎的口袋，然后她抬起眼睛，看向卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一双平静的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>我会离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>你们怎么在神色凝重地谈话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵突兀地加入了对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>只是医院要撤离，我们马上要分别了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>你把相片给法比安了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我正准备去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>好，替我安慰安慰他——你们刚刚是不是见到沃尔克中校了？他在哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>他进了防空洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔缓缓后退，似乎是想悄无声息地离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>好，他的枪修得像新的一样，我顺手给他拿回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>中校只中意他自己的这把，其他人想把备枪借他，他都婉拒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秒针再度冻结，这是太过漫长的一个瞬间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>等等，这是什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>他不是要退役了吗？！他不配枪不是因为他认为战争马上结束而他要回家了吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>什么？你们在说什么啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵仿佛听见了一个令人摸不着头脑的笑话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>中校会从前线转到后方指挥，怎么会突然退役？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>他正在被保荐授勋，到了秋天，应该就是上校了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>思维的雾气愈发浓密，卡戎竭力看清一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>威利，这不是你的猜测吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-527301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威利：</div><div>卡戎，我是中校的勤务兵出身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他或许不应该追问威利，他或许应该看着帕蒂塔的一举一动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-528011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>那个杀千刀的骗子！那只阴险狡猾的狐狸！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但是阻止她，难道就有意义了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>帕蒂塔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她快而敏捷地钻进了防空洞中，像一阵绝对不会被抓住的风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>字句疯狂地钻入卡戎的大脑，一切都变得紧绷又急促。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“瓦尔特死了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这他妈的是友方的炮火！它为什么会在我们突进的时候砸下来！”<br /><br />“该死，我没抓住他的手把他拽进弹坑，该死，该死，该死！”<br /><br />“只差一点点，只差一点点我就可以抓住他的！只是那一瞬间的事情！”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“天呐，我要怎么和帕蒂塔说？我要怎么和他的妈妈说？”<br /><br />“我活下来了，但是瓦尔特死了？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“或者告诉他们，真的很抱歉，活下来的不应该是我。”<br /><br />“应该是那个风趣健谈，能让所有人露出笑意的瓦尔特。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪声响起。纷乱嘈杂的思绪、闪现的词句、无数低语与喃喃都戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎看见中校捂紧胸口抽搐，没人能阻止大片红色的迸发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕蒂塔转头看向卡戎，她的面容变得宁静而模糊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>广袤，以至于包罗万象的苍穹之下，死与生都重归了寂静。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-07"}}